<title>DUBAI: Qatar's QGPC awards oil products tender.</title>
<headline>Qatar's QGPC awards oil products tender.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar General Petroleum Corp (QGPC) has awarded its third quarter oil products tender at a premium to independent Gulf price quotations, Qatari and Gulf market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The regular quarterly tender involved the sale of 120,000 tonnes of straight-run fuel oil, 100,000 tonnes of gas oil, 60,000 tonnes of jet A-1 fuel and 40,000 tonnes of mogas.</p>
<p>The winners of the tender and prices were not immediately known.</p>
</text>
